# Wave 52 §S (A, B) — Augur of Skulls' upkeep-only sacrifice. Its second ability
# is `ActivationPhases$ Upkeep | PlayerTurn$ True` (`res/cardsfolder/a/
# augur_of_skulls.txt`); with `skipNonStopPhases: 'always'` the upkeep was passed
# every turn. The scenario starts in seat 0's untap step so the game WALKS into
# upkeep: the restricted ability is activatable there, so the upkeep must stop.
# Mirri's Guile's upkeep trigger is optional ("you may"), so the same upkeep also
# carries a Yes/No confirm that is a real choice (B): it must still be asked,
# while the sacrifice confirm after choosing Augur's ability answers itself.
# Seat 1 holds nothing; its own library is all Swamps so its draw is harmless.
turn=1
activeplayer=human
activephase=UNTAP
humanlife=20
ailife=20
humanhand=
humanbattlefield=Augur of Skulls;Mirri's Guile;Swamp;Swamp
humanlibrary=Swamp;Swamp;Swamp;Swamp;Swamp;Swamp
humangraveyard=Swamp;Swamp
aihand=Swamp;Swamp;Swamp
aibattlefield=Swamp
ailibrary=Swamp;Swamp;Swamp;Swamp;Swamp;Swamp
aigraveyard=
